    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it, so it's about re-syncing those motor patterns. I've noticed some clients get really frustrated during those deload weeks because they feel like they're losing momentum or \"losing their edge.\" Is there a way to explain that mental/physical stagnation to them so they don't feel like their progress is just being stolen away?",
